      "reason": "Reconciled the domain map and skill spec with a fresh-consumer evaluation of all three packaged core skills at v2.0.0-alpha.3 using installed Intent 0.5.6. Three agents with no authoring conversation selected relevant skills through Intent and completed separate tasks. Successful load commands were logged. Known-good solutions passed the grader; deliberately narrow defaults failed type checks, and broken schema and scheduling solutions failed eight public browser checks. The unchanged grader passed all consumer type assertions and eight normal/Strict Mode browser checks. Skill hashes match the evaluated package; no guidance or tree mapping changes were needed. One positive attempt per task was observed. Negative activation tasks, repetitions, and a without-skill baseline remain unmeasured. Temporary artifacts and results are in /tmp/tanstack-form-intent-evaluation.",
